[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3399507564","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111528#issuecomment-3399507564","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111528","id":3399507564,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7KoF5s","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-14T00:25:51Z","updated_at":"2025-10-14T00:25:51Z","body":"Thanks for the review! I've updated the PR so that it now catches \"3.x\" or \"Unknown version\" feature tags and displays the upgrade behavior in those cases as well:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"922\" height=\"693\" alt=\"CleanShot 2025-10-13 at 17 19 56@2x\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5c0021bf-ce71-46d6-82eb-08cdc73cfab6\" />\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3399507564/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3492221070","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111528#issuecomment-3492221070","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111528","id":3492221070,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7QJxCO","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-05T16:35:42Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T16:35:42Z","body":"For the upgrade/downgrade icons, what are your thoughts on chevrons like this? I haven't had a chance to test them in action, just threw them together as a \"sketch\", but I think they could work.\r\n\r\nWhile I included the \"major downgrade\" version and made it consistent for completeness, it might be better to have it display a stronger \"incompatible\" indicator, like an ❌, since that downgrade process is likely to fail spectacularly due to breaking changes.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"440\" height=\"428\" alt=\"CleanShot 2025-11-05 at 08 27 45@2x\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/948be5c8-d513-4071-a5e9-303c2d6fceb3\" />\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3492221070/reactions","t