b.com/user-attachments/assets/ef2b6d1d-ee76-4b23-8565-d7c2bef94c0a)\r\n![ProjectUpgrade](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2759d41d-786b-4b76-a225-b5f2d75acf2a)\r\n![ProjectUpgradeMajor](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/433966be-01e2-40d1-8932-c56b12e1224e)\r\n\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3970316796/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3970593024","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111528#issuecomment-3970593024","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111528","id":3970593024,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7sqnEA","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-27T03:55:20Z","updated_at":"2026-02-27T03:55:20Z","body":"These versions with the rounded edges look great! I'm rather astonished now that I didn't try to round the corners of mine, as in hindsight they look quite sharp 😅\r\n\r\nI'll try importing those to see how they look in practice, but assuming they're good I'll see how I can add you as a coauthor to the PR as well 🙂\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3970593024/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3970771742","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111528#issuecomment-3970771742","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111528","id":3970771742,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7srSse","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-27T04:54:21Z","updated_at":"2026-02-27T04:54:21Z","body":"Indeed, I think it looks great!\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1001\" height=\"591\" alt=\"CleanShot 2026-02-26 at 20 51 08@2x\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/15827b09-7420-46cc-aa7c-85e8fb83e322\" />\r\n\r\nThere is another icon we will need in the same style, for when a conversion is necessary but we don't know if it'll be a downgrade or upgrade. It currently looks like this:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"541\" height=\"79\" alt=\"CleanShot 2026-02-26 at 20 51 47@2x\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/003a907a-1018-4b6e-ae8e-12784713c134\" />\r\n\r\nCurrently, it's basically the \"major upgrade/downgrade\" symbol, but pointing right and using the Node2D blue color. Would you be able to produce one of those (or something else if you think that would work better?) In the meantime, I'll get these ones added to the branch! ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3970771742/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3972761996","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111528#issuecomment-3972761996","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111528","id":3972761996,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7sy4mM","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-27T12:42:04Z","updated_at":"2026-02-27T12:48:11Z","body":"Agree with the feature; I just have some comments about the colors for now.\r\n\r\nWhile it's tempting to use green and red, I don't think they're a great fit here.\r\n- Best situation: Project is same version as the launcher. This could arguably be green, or grey, or \"nothing\" I suppose (as it is right now)\r\n- Worse fit: Project is in a previous version than the launcher. Opening it has real consequences, and we shouldn't communicate in the UI \"hey, it would be great if you opened this now!\". My suggestion for this is to use Godot blue: It's compatible, it's probably nice, but it's not an _invitation_ to open it.\r\n- Worst fit: Project is in a future version than the launcher. It's not _bad_ that this is the case, you probably just shouldn't do it. Orange or yellow comes to mind.\r\n\r\n> There is another icon we will need in the same style, for when a conversion is necessary but we don't know if it'll be a downgrade or upgrade. It currently looks like this:\r\n\r\nNot sure i understand this one. When does it happen? If it only happens for missing projects, I wouldn't show an icon at all.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3972761996/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3972785634","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111528#issuecomment-3972785634","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111528","id":3972785634,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7sy-Xi","user":{"login":"Geometror","id":50084500,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMDg0NTAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50084500?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror","html_url":"https://github.com/Geometror","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-27T12:46:45Z","updated_at":"2026-02-27T12:49:54Z","body":"Hmm, actually I don't know whether we should dedicate a new icon just for converting from an unknown version. When could that even happen other than with a corrupted project or when someone accidentally removed the version field in project.godot ? So we could:\r\n\r\n1. just assume upgrade and show the respective icon (not great)\r\n2. show no icon in this case\r\n3. show ⚠️\r\n\r\nPersonally, I'd go with 3.\r\n\r\nEDIT: This was written before I could see @Ivorforce 's comment :) \r\nI fully agree with the coloring suggestions.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3972785634/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3972840067","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111528#issuecomment-3972840067","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111528","id":3972840067,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7szLqD","user":{"login":"Zireael07","id":4525388,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MjUzODg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4525388?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07","html_url":"https://github.com/Zireael07","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-27T12:59:20Z","updated_at":"2026-02-27T12:59:47Z","body":"My suggestion: orange or red for old projects, Godot blue for future and no icon for same version\r\n\r\n(EDIT to add: trying to avoid red/yellow/green trifecta because red/green is most common variant of colorblindness)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3972840067/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3972861375","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111528#issuecomment-3972861375","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111528","id":3972861375,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7szQ2_","user":{"login":"Geometror","id":50084500,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMDg0NTAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50084500?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror","html_url":"https://github.com/Geometror","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-27T13:04:20Z","updated_at":"2026-02-27T13:04:20Z","body":"What about these?\r\n<img width=\"268\" height=\"292\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9d457def-8556-4c6d-b4bb-78765fcfdafc\" />\r\n\r\nyellow (ui warning color): #FFDD65\r\nblue (ui accent blue): #699CE8","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3972861375/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3973835436","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111528#issuecomment-3973835436","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111528","id":3973835436,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7s2-qs","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-27T16:23:33Z","updated_at":"2026-02-27T16:23:33Z","body":"Thanks for the feedback, everyone! To address everything:\r\n\r\nUpon thinking about it more, I agree that an arrow probably doesn't make sense for an \"unknown version\" and it makes more sense to just display a ⚠️ symbol, as it means something is wrong/weird there. I'll see about getting that updated in the branch.\r\n\r\nOverall I like the color ideas, and can add them to the branch soon here. The one thing I might want to reconsider is exactly how the colors are distributed. I think this could be a good use of colors:\r\n\r\n- 🟦 Minor upgrade (e.g., 4.6 → 4.7): Fairly safe upgrade. You might need to tweak a thing or two but it should be pretty seamless. **Blue is good here.**\r\n- 🟨 Major upgrade (e.g., 3.6 → 4.7): Significant work will almost certainly be involved. When you perform this upgrade, be prepared to spend a lot of time getting things fixed. **Yellow would indicate this is more risky.**\r\n- 🟨 Minor downgrade (e.g., 4.7 → 4.6): Some work will likely be involved. **Yellow would indicate this is also risky.**\r\n- 🟥 Major downgrade (e.g., 5.0 → 4.7): A lot of work likely involved. Be prepared to spend a lot of time fixing things, and you'll also likely be losing features/capabilities in the process. **Yellow or red would indicate this is very very risky.**\r\n\r\nThis being said, the color distribution isn't something that I feel _super_ strongly about, so if others still want to go with blue for upgrade and yellow for downgrade, then that's fine with me too.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3973835436/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3974069640","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111528#issuecomment-3974069640","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111528","id":3974069640,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7s332I","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-27T17:11:23Z","updated_at":"2026-02-27T17:11:23Z","body":"I've updated the PR to use the proposed changes! Here's how it currently looks:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"796\" height=\"521\" alt=\"CleanShot 2026-02-27 at 09 04 26@2x\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/081ece6a-fb1a-4f90-a320-ff592ea1927c\" />\r\n\r\nI noticed that the \"unknown project\" name is a little bit misleading; it seems that what triggers it is having a `project.godot` config version that's less than 4. This is not mutually exclusive with the version string in `config/features`, so by manually fiddling with the `project.godot` file it's possible to have an \"unknown version\" project where the version is listed 😅 That being said, I'm not sure what legitimate causes of an \"unknown version\" situation would be, and I don't think we should be overly worried about robustness against hand-corrupted project files.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3974069640/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3974254593","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111528#issuecomment-3974254593","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111528","id":3974254593,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7s4lAB","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-27T17:52:50Z","updated_at":"2026-02-27T17:52:50Z","body":"This is starting to get into bike shedding territory, but I'd go for the same color for both kinds of upgrades and both kinds of downgrades.\nMore specifically, i think we may not want to discourage the 3 to 4 upgrade with a yellow sign. \nMeanwhile, red usually indicated errors, so i would avoid it for an indicator.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3974254593/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3974464902","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111528#issuecomment-3974464902","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111528","id":3974464902,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7s5YWG","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-27T18:39:37Z","updated_at":"2026-02-27T18:39:37Z","body":"Fair, yeah I definitely don't want this to get bogged down by spending too much time trying to figure out the exact color scheme 😅 The PR as it is now has the color system you described; I suppose in the future if people find they have trouble with it, we can reconsider the colors at that time. But for now, blue for upgrade and yellow for downgrade works well enough!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3974464902/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3977972113","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111528#issuecomment-3977972113","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111528","id":3977972113,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7tGwmR","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-28T21:41:49Z","updated_at":"2026-02-28T21:41:49Z","body":"Thanks, it's now been removed!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3977972113/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4013415977","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111528#issuecomment-4013415977","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111528","id":4013415977,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7vN94p","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-06T18:44:40Z","updated_at":"2026-03-06T18:44:40Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4013415977/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]